WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.825
The dangers are quiet ones.

2
00:00:01.825 --> 00:00:05.474
A disable with live sessions
lets the leaver keep working,

3
00:00:05.474 --> 00:00:07.450
so the block needs both records.

4
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:13.362
A late H R entry is never processed by
the schedule, so S T 3 runs every time.

5
00:00:13.362 --> 00:00:15.788
A late re-send brings the account back.

6
00:00:15.788 --> 00:00:19.612
A failed revocation leaves the
card valid with nobody hearing.

7
00:00:19.612 --> 00:00:22.425
A privileged leaver's
disable task can't run.

8
00:00:22.425 --> 00:00:26.275
Deleting before devices are
retired leaves certificates valid.

9
00:00:26.275 --> 00:00:29.413
A threshold set without the
schedule passes everyone.

10
00:00:29.413 --> 00:00:33.340
And logs that age out before
export can't prove anything later.
